490
00:17:58,533 --> 00:18:00,500
- Of course, of course.

491
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,367
- [Joel] Grr.

492
00:18:02,367 --> 00:18:03,300
- I'm Jeeter.

493
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:04,500
- [Servo] The fast land animal.

494
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:06,767
