501
00:18:19,067 --> 00:18:19,900
Cool it.

502
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:20,833
Cool it, man, cool it!

503
00:18:20,833 --> 00:18:22,133
- [Servo] He's not worth it.

504
00:18:25,767 --> 00:18:28,100
