1021
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:16,867
Zach Norman as
Sammy in Chief Zabu?

1022
00:38:22,433 --> 00:38:23,767
- [Joel] Oh yeah. Oh yeah.

1023
00:38:23,767 --> 00:38:25,967
- [Servo] Ah, that's better.

1024
00:38:25,967 --> 00:38:28,933
