1025
00:38:28,933 --> 00:38:29,833
- [Crow] Boss hog.

1026
00:38:32,067 --> 00:38:33,100
That's right, Fatty.

1027
00:38:33,100 --> 00:38:34,533
Seize the day.

1028
00:38:34,533 --> 00:38:35,600
- [Servo] Carpe diem.

1029
00:38:38,700 --> 00:38:39,900
Bording!

1030
00:38:39,900 --> 00:38:40,933
Ebbybody bup!

1031
00:38:40,933 --> 00:38:43,267
