wife burns a dinner?

1042
00:39:09,433 --> 00:39:11,100
Husband gets drunk?
I've seen it.

1043
00:39:11,100 --> 00:39:12,000
- How interesting.

1044
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:14,367
- [Servo] Let me
see here, it's...

1045
00:39:14,367 --> 00:39:15,900
Oh, I forgot, I can't read.

1046
00:39:18,400 --> 00:39:20,667
- You just lost ten.

1047
00:39:20,667 --> 00:39:25,367
- Are going to the races?

1048
00:39:25,367 --> 00:39:27,700
- [Joel] No, we're
going to Disneyland.

1049
00:39:27,700 --> 00:39:29,600
- We're going to the races.

1050
00:39:29,600 --> 00:39:31,467
I wouldn't miss
that for anything.

1051
00:39:31,467 --> 00:39:32,867
- [Servo] Unless I die.

1052
00:39:34,133 --> 00:39:35,967
- [Joel] But first let's
look at some footage

1053
00:39:35,967 --> 00:39:38,700
