a series of spins.

1056
00:39:42,067 --> 00:39:44,633
The cars attempt to weave
their way through the pack.

1057
00:39:44,633 --> 00:39:46,533
One car lost a wheel

1058
00:39:46,533 --> 00:39:49,000
