survival of the fittest!

1059
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,467
- [Servo] But is really not.

1060
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:53,800
- [Crow] Hey, the
wheel's winning!

1061
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:54,900
Get back on the track!

1062
00:39:55,967 --> 00:39:57,200
- [Servo] Where are they going?

1063
00:39:57,200 --> 00:39:58,433
- [Announcer] Car number
one is over the wall.

1064
00:39:58,433 --> 00:40:00,467
That's Buck Shepperton
over the east wall.

1065
00:40:00,467 --> 00:40:02,833
- [Crow] But it's far
too expensive to show us.

1066
00:40:08,867 --> 00:40:11,067
