Buck is pinned in his car.

1067
00:40:11,067 --> 00:40:13,200
It appears it will take a
torch to free Buck Shepperton.

1068
00:40:13,200 --> 00:40:15,300
- [Joel] Or a really
good pair of scissors

1069
00:40:15,300 --> 00:40:16,867
