packing industry.

1071
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:21,200
- [Servo] Boy, that
announcer's really smart.

1072
00:40:21,200 --> 00:40:24,767
- [Crow] A few nose
donuts. (chuckles)

1073
00:40:26,033 --> 00:40:27,800
- [Joel] Hey, what are
you lookin' at, jerk?

1074
00:40:31,567 --> 00:40:34,067
- [Servo] Kids are just
too damn smart these days.

1075
00:40:38,067 --> 00:40:39,300
