1076
00:40:39,300 --> 00:40:40,667
Remember, you're undercover!

1077
00:40:40,667 --> 00:40:41,767
Don't talk to anybody!

1078
00:40:41,767 --> 00:40:42,700
- [Servo] Shh!

1079
00:40:42,700 --> 00:40:43,933
- Everything okay?

1080
00:40:43,933 --> 00:40:44,900
- Everything's
ready, Lieutenant.

1081
00:40:44,900 --> 00:40:46,500
- [Crow] Don't call me that.

1082
00:40:46,500 --> 00:40:47,833
- Good. Rod's been briefed.

1083
00:40:47,833 --> 00:40:48,800
