1084
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,333
- Make him look good, Dutch.

1085
00:40:50,333 --> 00:40:51,833
- Will do, Lieutenant.

1086
00:40:51,833 --> 00:40:52,800
- Good luck.

1087
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:53,733
- [Crow] Forget I ever met you.

1088
00:40:53,733 --> 00:40:55,100
- [Servo] I love you.

1089
00:40:55,100 --> 00:40:56,367
Nice caboose there, huh?

1090
00:40:57,567 --> 00:40:58,900
He's smart, too.

1091
00:40:58,900 --> 00:40:59,833
