like this place.

1092
00:40:59,833 --> 00:41:01,333
Gives me the willies.

1093
00:41:01,333 --> 00:41:02,867
Hey, look, it's Mount Rushmore.

1094
00:41:03,933 --> 00:41:06,100
- [Servo] Mount Trashmore.

1095
00:41:08,200 --> 00:41:09,467
(Servo humming)

1096
00:41:09,467 --> 00:41:10,933
