a brief retirement,

1097
00:41:10,933 --> 00:41:13,333
Rod Tillman returns here to the
speedway in a new number 57.

1098
00:41:14,200 --> 00:41:16,200
- [Servo] Old Blue Eyes is back.

1099
00:41:16,200 --> 00:41:18,067
