until he says go!

1111
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:48,667
(engines rumbling)

1112
00:41:50,933 --> 00:41:52,467
- [Announcer] Well,
the starter is running.

1113
00:41:52,467 --> 00:41:54,500
And off they go now on that
warmup lap getting into place.

1114
00:41:54,500 --> 00:41:57,467
(mimicking engines)

1115
00:41:59,867 --> 00:42:01,133
- [Announcer] And off they go!

1116
00:42:01,133 --> 00:42:03,333
All speed records should
