Eat it, boy, eat it!

1147
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:40,533
- [Crow] I have the worst luck!

1148
00:43:41,467 --> 00:43:42,700
- [Servo] Boy...

1149
00:43:42,700 --> 00:43:44,100
