1158
00:43:59,900 --> 00:44:01,433
- [Joel] That was fun.

1159
00:44:01,433 --> 00:44:02,900
What a day.

1160
00:44:02,900 --> 00:44:04,567
- [Servo] I love it.

1161
00:44:05,433 --> 00:44:07,800
