1214
00:46:08,300 --> 00:46:09,233
- Pour on the milk!

1215
00:46:10,133 --> 00:46:11,100
One, two.

1216
00:46:11,100 --> 00:46:12,300
One, two, three, four.

1217
00:46:12,300 --> 00:46:14,533
♪ Wild Rebels ♪

1218
00:46:14,533 --> 00:46:16,800
♪ Funchy crunchy rebels ♪

1219
00:46:16,800 --> 00:46:17,867
♪ Don't bust your teeth ♪

1220
00:46:17,867 --> 00:46:20,200
♪ On something sweet and hard ♪

1221
00:46:20,200 --> 00:46:22,100
