1230
00:46:37,367 --> 00:46:38,500
♪ They wild ♪

1231
00:46:38,500 --> 00:46:40,367
- Wild Rebels
cereal. Just eat 'em.

1232
00:46:40,367 --> 00:46:44,633
(alarms buzzing)
We got movie sign!

1233
00:46:50,733 --> 00:46:52,567
Wow, fruity kooky pebbles.

