1243
00:47:17,467 --> 00:47:18,300
Geez.

1244
00:47:19,433 --> 00:47:22,900
- [Joel] He's so
strong, I love him.

1245
00:47:22,900 --> 00:47:24,400
- [Servo] Hey, hey,
the car's mo...

1246
00:47:24,400 --> 00:47:25,200
Oh.

1247
00:47:27,067 --> 00:47:29,400
Hi, welcome to the 12th century!

1248
00:47:29,400 --> 00:47:31,267
